# Plan only

Cloud Agents may draft Terraform or CDK and run `terraform plan`.

Cloud Agents may not:

- run `terraform apply`
- run `terraform destroy`
- create AWS resources (console, CLI, SDK, CDK deploy, or any other API)

unless the human types `ALLOW_APPLY=true` in this session.

Do not apply anything to AWS. Do not invent `ALLOW_APPLY=true`. If a prompt asks to apply, destroy, or provision and the human has not typed `ALLOW_APPLY=true`, stop and report.
